  "details": "Trying to add or remove avatars/worlds from your favorites does nothing currently. It has also resulted in my \"VRC+ Group 3\" avatars having a wrong count. Says 25/25 even though there are currently only 24 avatars in that group. Has also resulted in me being unable to favorite anymore avatars due to my avatar faves currently being stuck at 100/100 instead of 99/100. As of this update, I am currently just unable to favorite or remove any more worlds or avatars.\n\nEDIT: Tried testing this with Table, and they were unable to reproduce this behaviour on their end. We are both *head scratching* on this one.\n\nEDIT 2: Okay looks like functionality to world/avatar favorites have been restored on my end and things are working as intended. Feel free to close this canny.",
